# draw.io in moli-*/README.md

Each microservice README is the **first draft** for that service (see root `AGENTS.md` §4).

If the README includes architecture, deployment, or call-chain sections:

1. Use `.cursor/skills/drawio-diagrams/SKILL.md` — do not leave ASCII diagrams as the main figure
2. Put sources in `docs/diagrams/`; README links to PNG + `.drawio`
3. Point full design docs to `docs/design/` or `docs/zh-CN/ARCHITECTURE.md`
